OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge boss resigns as chain
OL,4,Atackles security after sex assault at
OL,5,Ahotel
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe boss of hotel chain Travelodge, Jo
OL,8,FBoydell, is stepping down as the group
OL,9,Faddresses safety issues after a sexual
OL,10,Fassault at one of its hotels.
OL,12,FA woman staying at a hotel in
OL,13,FMaidenhead, Berkshire was sexually
OL,14,Fassaulted in December 2022 after a man
OL,15,Flied to staff to get a key card to her
OL,16,Froom, triggering an independent review
OL,17,Fof security measures at the firm.
OL,19,FKyran Smith was jailed for seven years
OL,20,Fand six months for the attack.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
