OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge boss resigns as chain
OL,4,Atackles security after sex assault at
OL,5,Ahotel
OL,6,
OL,7,FBoydell had been criticised for the
OL,8,Fcompany's handling of safety issues. In
OL,9,FMarch, then Prime Minister Sir Keir
OL,10,FStarmer wrote to Boydell urging her to
OL,11,F"seriously engage" with the government
OL,12,Fover security at Travelodge hotels.
